## Overview

This guide series will go over the basics of creating a pathfinding algorithm from scratch. I am modeling this after my own experience of brute forcing the learning process, so each guide will build on top of the previous one.

As such, it is split into 4 parts:
- Flood Fill (Basics of creating a node network)
- Breadth First Search (Solving Mazes)
- A* (Basic Pathfinding)
- Pathfinding Adjustments (Verticality, ladders)

